5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to help! I want to make sure our new service is really stable and won't be interrupted by things we can't control.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble goal, Yumi. I suspect we might find the answers we seek if we stop guessing and actually look at what we've done before.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Let's not get carried away with sentiment. We need to know if we actually have the capacity to handle these proposals without breaking the system.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Shion. However, I am more concerned about the long-term financial structure. We need to see how the money is actually allocated.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I just... I worry about who can actually get to the library. I want to see if the locations are fair for everyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that's so kind of you to think about! I'll look into the roads and the buses too, just to be safe!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,How charmingly optimistic. I shall focus on the archives of our previous attempts to avoid repeating the same elegant mistakes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, your nostalgia is tedious. I'm interested in the human element—specifically, who is actually qualified to do the work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will examine the grant terms. It is essential to understand the constraints of our funding to ensure the service survives past the first year.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll just look at the bus links and the road closures. If that's okay with everyone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I think I've decided! I'll check the winter road closures and the bus links. Let's make this great!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll be examining the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. History is a wonderful teacher.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll take the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. Let's see what ""skills"" we actually possess.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also look into the running and equipment lines from last year to see where the budget leaks occur.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
